{"ID":"20240314091819-0ucmvmi","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091819-0ucmvmi","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091819-0ucmvmi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171006-vncsrbh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171006-ond2b9x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171006-ond2b9x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:186,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:186\u0026#125;","title":"【葵子茯苓散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171006-vncsrbh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171006-vncsrbh","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妊娠有水气，身重，小便不利，洒淅恶寒，起即头眩，葵子茯苓"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171006-k8zojc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171006-k8zojc1","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"葵子茯苓散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171006-9cza6e1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171006-9cza6e1","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"葵子一升茯苓三两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171006-20wurij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171006-20wurij","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味杵为散，饮服方寸匕，日二服，小便利则愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171006-kcc48qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171006-kcc48qm","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后面这个处方呢也是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小便不利，但是是水肿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171006-m3ucaoi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171006-m3ucaoi","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以怀孕中间，如果太太走进来，看那个下半身，脚啊都是肿的，水肿的很严重，不要开那个刚刚的那个当归贝母苦参汤丸，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"要开葵子茯苓散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。像前面那个当归贝母苦参汤我们是不好意思不好意思讲，那个小孩子会压到妈妈的那个膀胱排不出来，那这个妈妈疑心病很重，有的太太疑心病很重哦，她一旦怀孕以后，就看先生到哪儿去了对不对？所以先生做什么小动作她都会注意啊，看到都不对，所以说这个人的心啊...所以你要跟太太说不要想太多，有的太太怀孕了就会有忧郁症啊，这里面都有处方的哦，我们都有处方可以治疗的啊！所以当医生的，你要特别跟太太讲，不要看什么都不对。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171006-l1la1k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171006-l1la1k1","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平常都不会哦，一怀孕以后，尤其到了八、九、十个月的时候啊，快要生的时候，就要求...先生每天必须要按时回家或怎么样子，她没有先生在，她不安心呐，她就会东想西想，小孩子移动位置，压到了膀胱，就会小便出不来了。我们休息一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171006-1qh9hyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171006-1qh9hyr","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个葵子茯苓散也是很有名的一个方剂，专门治疗孕妇在怀孕的 10 个月中间，全身水肿或者下半身水肿，都可以使用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个葵子茯苓散专门是治疗水肿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比例呢，因为散剂嘛，你要记得 3 比 1 就可以了，也就是说你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葵子用 3，茯苓用 1，然后打成粉啊，那三餐饭前呢，吃一个汤匙"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个上面是写一天吃两次，你可以一天吃 3 次，小便利出来就好了啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240422171006-ond2b9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171006-ond2b9x","updated":"20240422171006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那中药利尿很好玩，当你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用中药把小便利出来以后啊，这个水不会再回来，你如果用利尿剂祛，不行，这个水就会回来啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！然后有时利尿剂呢...比如说我们的这个羊水很多，你一吃利尿剂，结果羊水跑了，身上还是肿，都不对，会太过！中药的好处就是它非常温和，它把不要的水排掉。因为你看它"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么用茯苓？茯苓就是它本身能够通利三焦的水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个葵子可以增加通利，增加茯苓的力量，加强排水的力量而已啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！"}]}]}